## Part 3 — Time-Series Results (One Full Revolution)
"""

# ╔═╡ a1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000014
begin
    # ── Time vector covering one full revolution ───────────────────────────────
    T_period = 2π / ω₃
    t_arr    = range(0, T_period, length=600)
    θ_arr    = ω₃ .* t_arr          # θ₃(t) = ω₃·t  (starting at 0)

